# Rust / Cargo
/target/
**/target/
**/*.rs.bk
Cargo.lock.bak

# Python / build
**/dist/
**/__pycache__/
**/*.egg-info/
**/.eggs/
**/build/

# Workspace 锁文件策略:
# - Library crate: .gitignore (不跟踪)
# - Binary / application crate: 跟踪
# 我们现在是 hybrid, 整个 workspace 跟踪一份 Cargo.lock.
# 等到了 ma_harness_cli 出现 binary, 评估是否拆 workspace 锁文件策略.

# Editor
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
*.swo
*~

# OS
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# Build / coverage / benchmark 产物
/coverage/
/criterion-cache/
/perf.data*
/flamegraph.svg

# 临时调试
*.log
*.tmp
/.env
# git commit -F <file> 临时 commit message 草稿 (不跟踪)
.commit-msg-*.md
/.env.local
/.env.*.local

# 工具链
/.rustup/
/.cargo/registry/
/.cargo/git/

